   "text": "0 allocations at runtime.\nstr_join/extract_message solutions copy\nthe WHOLE buffer on every recv \u2192 O(L\u00b2)\nfor fragmented lines; here every byte\nis copied exactly once \u2192 O(L)",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "0 allocations at runtime.\nstr_join/extract_message solutions copy\nthe WHOLE buffer on every recv \u2192 O(L\u00b2)\nfor fragmented lines; here every byte\nis copied exactly once \u2192 O(L)",
   "autoResize": true,
