   "text": "a line is flushed the instant its '\\n'\narrives \u2014 inside the scan loop.\nno queues, no double buffering.\n(subject: \u00absend as fast as you can,\ndon't do un-necessary buffer\u00bb)",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "a line is flushed the instant its '\\n'\narrives \u2014 inside the scan loop.\nno queues, no double buffering.\n(subject: \u00absend as fast as you can,\ndon't do un-necessary buffer\u00bb)",
   "autoResize": true,
